      ],
      "source": "https://beckdc.com/historical-places-in-waller/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Neely Mansion, built in the late 1800s, offers guided tours of pioneer life.",
